# CHAIR-02 — Execution tribunal synthesis (runcontrol, runtime, process, concurrency, leases, cancellation, arbitration, failure semantics)

### Scope inspected

**Implementation repo** `/home/antonioborgerees/coding/ultraplan/gauntlet-run/ultraplan-go` @ eeaa034cb1e520ea10e806870f6026cf1bb6c4f7 (verified clean before/after; read-only):

- Read in full by the chair firsthand: `internal/app/run_control.go` (667 lines), `internal/app/durable_operations.go` (255 lines).
- Read firsthand in decisive regions: `internal/platform/runtime/runtime.go` (`Adapter.StartRun` :264–355), `internal/sprint/execute.go` (:185–334 OnEvent closure + main loop), `internal/runcontrol/lifecycle.go` (`Heartbeat` :14–68, reconciliation loop :340–509 incl. `reconcileUnclaimed`, `reconcileProcessDecision`, fire-and-forget evidence sites :352/:411), `internal/runcontrol/sqlite.go` (`Append` :608–699 incl. sanitize gate :617 and compaction :687–689; `ProposeTerminal` :722–807 CAS; `reservedEventType` :713–720; `classifyStoreError` :1085–1108; `expiredLeasePredicate` :1129–1141).
- External module verified at pinned version: `github.com/Antonio7098/agentwrap@v0.0.0-20260821190033-e79a38a58da3`, `opencode/runtime.go` run-goroutine LIFO defers (:284–291).
- Test inventories read: `app/run_control_test.go` (3 tests), `app/durable_operations_test.go` (2 tests), sprint fakes (`session_state_test.go:19`, `execute_state_test.go:35`, `efficiency_improvements_test.go:384`, `review_test.go:55` — all synchronous-inside-StartRun), `sprint/service.go` mutex inventory.
- **Commands**: `go build ./...` (clean); `go test -race -count=1 ./internal/runcontrol ./internal/app ./internal/sprint` — all pass (detector silence is coverage absence, see F03).

